[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_4EP_C08_PIN_GAME_1_CODEBOOK]
Empire Fire Experts Codebook

[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_4EP_C08_PIN_GAME_1_CODEBOOK_DESC]
We have translated this codebook into brooch language. The codebook works as follows:
1. An §Cencrypted message§! is a random arrangement of a 4-digit code that needs to be restored to the §Gcorrect order§!.
2. The codebook contains multiple lines of codes, §Yone and only one line§! contains all 4 digits of the §Cencrypted message§!.
3. The order of the codes in the line §Yfrom left to right§! is the §Gcorrect order§! of the codes in the §Cencrypted message§!.
4. The 4-digit code in the §Gcorrect order§! is the decrypted message.

